"colis. La clé se vérifiera au premier suivi, et le colis dira ce qui s'est "
"passé."
msgstr ""
"This carrier has no call that checks a key without querying a parcel. The "
"key will be checked at the first tracking attempt, and the parcel will say "
"what happened."

