"Purolator ne publie ni sa WSDL ni sa documentation sans compte :\n"
"                            le suivi n'est pas branché, et un numéro Purolator se suit à la\n"
"                            main. La clé de développement s'obtient au portail\n"
"                            ship.purolator.com/developer ; la clé de production exige un\n"
"                            numéro de compte d'affaires, la certification de l'intégration\n"
"                            et trois contacts de l'entreprise."
msgstr ""
"Purolator publishes neither its WSDL nor its documentation without an "
"account:\n                            tracking is not connected, and a "
"Purolator number is followed by\n                            hand. The "
"development key is obtained from the\n                            "
"ship.purolator.com/developer portal; the production key requires a\n       "
"business account number, certification of the integration\n                "
"and three contacts from the business."

